<title>UK: Helaba unit sets $200 million Eurobond due 2000.</title>
<headline>Helaba unit sets $200 million Eurobond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas. </p>
<p> BORROWER   HELABA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LANDESBANK HESSEN-THUERINGEN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    21.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9595  PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.772    SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/IR/GE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
